      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are interpreting wanting them to be free of your mistakes as the ultimate act of love, but true love often involves staying and fighting for things together. Seeking therapy isn't selfish; it’s an act of deep self-respect and a commitment to changing your trajectory. Allowing yourself to be helped is the most active way you can contribute positively to your family's environment moving forward. Please reach out to a crisis hotline or mental health professional right now to talk through these intense feelings.",
